{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38143","headline":"离家第二日却寄诸兄弟 · 韩偓","name":"离家第二日却寄诸兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睡起褰帘日出时，今辰初恨间容辉。\n千行泪激傍人感，一点心随健步归。\n却望山川空黯黯，回看僮仆亦依依。\n定知兄弟高楼上，遥指征途羡鸟飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}